<figure class="network-figure">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 760 360" role="img" aria-labelledby="network-title network-desc">
    <title id="network-title">二维分类神经网络结构</title>
    <desc id="network-desc">
      输入变量 A 和 B 连接到一个包含两个节点的隐藏层，再输出二分类概率和类别。
    </desc>
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="network-flow" x1="0" x2="1">
        <stop offset="0" stop-color="var(--colour-primary)"></stop>
        <stop offset="1" stop-color="var(--colour-secondary)"></stop>
      </linearGradient>
    </defs>

    <g class="connections" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M150 108 L355 118"></path>
      <path d="M150 108 L355 242"></path>
      <path d="M150 252 L355 118"></path>
      <path d="M150 252 L355 242"></path>
      <path d="M405 118 L610 180"></path>
      <path d="M405 242 L610 180"></path>
    </g>

    <g class="layer-labels" aria-hidden="true">
      <text x="125" y="42">输入层</text>
      <text x="380" y="42">隐藏层 · 2 节点</text>
      <text x="635" y="42">分类输出</text>
    </g>

    <g class="node node--input">
      <circle cx="125" cy="108" r="40"></circle>
      <text x="125" y="114">A</text>
    </g>
    <g class="node node--input">
      <circle cx="125" cy="252" r="40"></circle>
      <text x="125" y="258">B</text>
    </g>

    <g class="node node--hidden">
      <circle cx="380" cy="118" r="40"></circle>
      <text x="380" y="124">H1</text>
    </g>
    <g class="node node--hidden">
      <circle cx="380" cy="242" r="40"></circle>
      <text x="380" y="248">H2</text>
    </g>

    <g class="node node--output">
      <circle cx="635" cy="180" r="48"></circle>
      <text x="635" y="175">概率</text>
      <text x="635" y="197">/ 类别</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    两个数值输入先标准化；模型使用 1 个隐藏层、2 个隐藏节点和 1000 epochs。
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .network-figure {
    margin: 0;
    padding: clamp(var(--space-4), 4vw, var(--space-7));
    border: 1px solid var(--colour-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        circle at 50% 45%,
        color-mix(in srgb, var(--colour-primary) 10%, transparent),
        transparent 45%
      ),
      var(--colour-surface);
  }

  svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .connections path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: url(#network-flow);
    stroke-width: 3;
    opacity: 0.58;
  }

  .node circle {
    stroke: var(--colour-border-strong);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .node--input circle {
    fill: var(--colour-surface-raised);
  }

  .node--hidden circle {
    fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--colour-primary) 18%, var(--colour-surface));
  }

  .node--output circle {
    fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--colour-secondary) 20%, var(--colour-surface));
  }

  text {
    fill: var(--colour-text);
    font-family: var(--font-family-sans);
    text-anchor: middle;
  }

  .node text {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .layer-labels text {
    fill: var(--colour-text-muted);
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  figcaption {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-3);
    color: var(--colour-text-muted);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
  }

  @media (max-width: 34rem) {
    .network-figure {
      overflow-x: auto;
    }

    svg {
      width: 42rem;
      max-width: none;
    }
  }
</style>
